# "Creatures you control but don't own are Mercenaries in addition to their other types": on turn 3 Bot1 casts Thieving Skydiver kicked with
# X 1 and takes Bot2's Ornithopter (mana value 0, an artifact creature Bot2 owns), which becomes a Mercenary - an outlaw (CR 700.12) - while
# Bot2's own Llanowar Elves, which Bot1 does not control, and Bot1's own creatures are not changed. On turn 5 Flint's upkeep trigger
# counts three outlaws, Flint (Lizard Rogue), the Skydiver (Merfolk Rogue) and the Ornithopter (Mercenary Thopter), and exiles the top 3 cards of
# Bot2's library; with only the two it would own it would exile 2. Together with the 1 card exiled in the turn-3 upkeep, when Flint was
# alone, 4 cards are in exile (Bot1 cast none of them).

